 "note": "Buckets are by how many of the up to 5 ORIGINAL annotators agreed with the original gold (5 unanimous, 4, 3 bare majority) or 'dash' when the original gold was '-' (no majority). For each bucket we count how often ChaosNLI's old gold still equals the 100-vote plurality (old_eq_plur) vs flips (old_diff_plur), and how often the 100 votes reach a strict (>50) majority (strict) vs none (no_strict). P1 is a structural coverage bet; P2 and P3 are directional (a finding either way), with the exact per-bucket rates reported. ChaosNLI is CC BY-NC 4.0; this audit reads the official release and reports counts, it does not redistribute it."
